## 1. Introduction

Welcome to Propal.ja ("Propal.ja", "we", "us", or "our").

Propal.ja is a digital platform designed to help customers discover and connect with independent professionals, request services, receive proposals, communicate, arrange bookings, and share reviews. Professionals can create profiles, advertise their services, respond to requests, and connect with potential customers.

We respect your privacy and are committed to handling personal information responsibly. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, when we share it, how we protect it, and the choices and rights available to you.

By using Propal.ja, you acknowledge that you have been given access to this Privacy Policy. Where consent is required, we will request it separately and appropriately.

